The caster's skin grows as hard as stone, granting a [12, 17, 20, 23, 26 (TL1-5; SP 100)] bonus to Armour.

Each time you are hit in melee, you have a [31%, 54%, 66%, 74%, 79% (TL1-5)] chance to reduce the cooldown of an Earth or Stone spell by 2 (this effect can only happen once per turn).

The bonus to Armour will increase with your Spellpower.
